 "captions": [
  {
   "at": 0.0,
   "until": 1.93,
   "text": "Tokyo took a tea break. And"
  },
  {
   "at": 1.99,
   "until": 4.06,
   "text": "left America with an unfunded bar"
  },
  {
   "at": 4.13,
   "until": 6.64,
   "text": "tab. The Fed hasn't moved, but"
  },
  {
   "at": 6.68,
   "until": 7.95,
   "text": "your borrowing costs climbed"
  },
  {
   "at": 7.99,
   "until": 10.3,
   "text": "anyway. Three men in blue ties"
  },
  {
   "at": 10.36,
   "until": 12.14,
   "text": "blame the deficit, the Fed, or"
  },
  {
   "at": 12.19,
   "until": 14.42,
   "text": "the vibes at Jackson Hole. On"
  },
  {
   "at": 14.49,
   "until": 16.16,
   "text": "YouTube, it's sixty-three stick"
  },
  {
   "at": 16.22,
   "until": 18.25,
   "text": "figures. Here's what nobody on"
  },
  {
   "at": 18.29,
   "until": 19.85,
   "text": "that panel is watching: our"
  },
  {
   "at": 19.92,
   "until": 21.68,
   "text": "biggest lender. The Treasury's"
  },
  {
   "at": 21.73,
   "until": 23.4,
   "text": "table shows Japan holds over a"
  },
  {
   "at": 23.47,
   "until": 25.19,
   "text": "trillion dollars of our debt, and"
  },
  {
   "at": 25.23,
   "until": 26.99,
   "text": "it's been selling since February."
  },
  {
   "at": 27.5,
   "until": 29.66,
   "text": "I ran risk at JPMorgan; when"
  },
  {
   "at": 29.7,
   "until": 31.31,
   "text": "your biggest customer walks, the"
  },
  {
   "at": 31.36,
   "until": 33.26,
   "text": "auction sets your price. The"
  },
  {
   "at": 33.31,
   "until": 35.05,
   "text": "opponent isn't the Fed; it's a"
  },
  {
   "at": 35.13,
   "until": 36.77,
   "text": "Japanese balance sheet. Two"
  },
  {
   "at": 36.84,
   "until": 38.59,
   "text": "numbers show where the money went:"
  },
  {
   "at": 39.05,
   "until": 41.08,
   "text": "a Treasury page, and your phone."
  },
  {
   "at": 41.58,
   "until": 43.34,
   "text": "By the end you'll read both"
  },
  {
   "at": 43.4,
   "until": 44.4,
   "text": "numbers yourself."
  },
  {
   "at": 45.0,
   "until": 46.74,
   "text": "Since February, Japan has sold a"
  },
  {
   "at": 46.8,
   "until": 47.98,
   "text": "hundred and twenty-two billion"
  },
  {
   "at": 48.04,
   "until": 49.3,
   "text": "dollars of it, a tenth of"
  },
  {
   "at": 49.34,
   "until": 51.29,
   "text": "the pile. The Treasury prints the"
  },
  {
   "at": 51.35,
   "until": 53.03,
   "text": "new total monthly, and that print"
  },
  {
   "at": 53.07,
   "until": 55.24,
   "text": "is your first number. Tokyo has"
  },
  {
   "at": 55.31,
   "until": 57.27,
   "text": "pledged ten trillion yen to chips,"
  },
  {
   "at": 57.29,
   "until": 58.77,
   "text": "and if that works, it beats"
  },
  {
   "at": 58.81,
   "until": 60.47,
   "text": "our bonds. And here's what nobody"
  },
  {
   "at": 60.53,
   "until": 62.54,
   "text": "says: the money went home, and"
  },
  {
   "at": 62.59,
   "until": 65.08,
   "text": "the tab stayed here. So, the"
  },
  {
   "at": 65.15,
   "until": 67.44,
   "text": "second number: it's on your phone."
  },
  {
   "at": 67.82,
   "until": 69.31,
   "text": "Pull up Meta and find its"
  },
  {
   "at": 69.35,
   "until": 71.48,
   "text": "price-to-earnings multiple: that's"
  },
  {
   "at": 71.53,
   "until": 72.64,
   "text": "the share of the price that's"
  },
  {
   "at": 72.69,
   "until": 74.06,
   "text": "profit not yet earned, and a"
  },
  {
   "at": 74.13,
   "until": 76.2,
   "text": "higher yield discounts it. The Fed"
  },
  {
   "at": 76.26,
   "until": 78.59,
   "text": "still hasn't moved. Tokyo is still"
  },
  {
   "at": 78.68,
   "until": 80.12,
   "text": "on its tea break. And that"
  },
  {
   "at": 80.2,
   "until": 82.72,
   "text": "unfunded bar tab is still ours."
  }
 ],
